it can't pay for the swap without this.\n4. On rh1, swap 246,666 WBTC for about 0.04923 ETH (q_10, $0.36).\n5. Bridge 247,500 WBTC to arb1, which lands 246,666 (q_4, $1.40).\n6. Bridge 0.001 ETH to arb1 for gas, which lands 0.000833 ETH (q_8, $1.40). arb1 also holds no ETH.\n7. On arb1, swap 246,666 WBTC for about 147.70 USDC (q_11, $0.36).\n\nThe two halves are 246,666 each rather than 247,500, because the bridge fee comes out of each half. For the Arbitrum half, bridging WBTC and swapping there is cheaper than swapping on Ethereum and bridging USDC. That route would cost about $5.30.\n\nThe route leaves about 0.048 ETH on eth1 for gas. I'll execute the legs one at a time once you approve."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_12"},"id":"toolu_019H6TqZewLq1HCzfPLWA9PE"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_13\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_019H6TqZewLq1HCzfPLWA9PE","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_13"},"id":"toolu_014QKiQjuGs8UtbkqhpLUTQN"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_014QKiQjuGs8UtbkqhpLUTQN","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":33,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_01Tt245C9KP84rAdWHNpd7hN"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":34,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Tt245C9KP84rAdWHNpd7hN","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isE